# License — Aster Studio

Aster Studio is a proprietary commercial website template created and distributed by simpleDesigns.

Purchase of this template grants the buyer a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use, modify, and customize the template for one website or client project.

## Permitted Use

- Use the template for personal or commercial websites.
- Modify, customize, and adapt the source code.
- Deploy the finished website on your own hosting provider.
- Use the template to create a website for one client.
- Use the finished website for commercial purposes.

## Restrictions

- You may not resell, redistribute, share, or sublicense the original template.
- You may not distribute the source code as a standalone template, theme, starter kit, or competing product.
- You may not sell or redistribute modified versions of the template or its underlying components.
- You may not claim ownership of the original Aster Studio template, design, or source code.
- You may not use one purchased license for multiple websites or unrelated client projects.

A separate license is required for each additional website or client project.

## Ownership

The original template, including its design, layout, and source code, remains the intellectual property of simpleDesigns.

Buyers retain ownership of their own original content, branding, images, and other materials they add to their customized website, subject to applicable third-party licenses.

## Third-Party Assets

Third-party libraries, fonts, images, icons, and other assets remain subject to their respective licenses and usage restrictions.

The buyer is responsible for ensuring that third-party assets used in their finished website are properly licensed.

## Licensing Questions

For extended usage rights, multiple-project licensing, or other licensing questions, please contact simpleDesigns.